{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UplaIQXFxboLGI-w7uR75g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:07.749930+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UplaIQXFxboLGI-w7uR75g","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>华东师范大学数据科学与工程学院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生（含直接攻博）预报名已开始，欢迎校内外广大优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式攻读数据科学与工程学院2026年博士生、硕士生。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件及要求</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民；</span></p><p><span>2.拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></p><p><span>3.优秀应届本科毕业生，并已获得或预计能够获得本科就读学校推荐免试资格；</span></p><p><span>4.学习成绩优异，并具有较强的创新意识、研究潜质、专业基础等；</span></p><p><span>5.身心健康，符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式与要求</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.通过推荐免试方式攻读我学院2026年博士生、硕士生的校内外优秀应届本科毕业生需通过我校研究生报考服务系统（网址：https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5）报名。</span></p><p><span>2.系统开放时间：2025年9月2日9:00--9月12日12:00。推荐尽早在系统中完成报名。</span></p><p><span>3.请考生按照系统要求提交材料，同时须保证提交材料真实、准确，无弄虚作假、学术不端。</span></p><p><span>4.博士生报名请在\"备用信息\"栏填写\"意向导师\"信息。</span></p><p><span>5.注册账号、登录系统后，请按下列要求上传材料的电子版本。包括：</span></p></section><section><p><span>（1）居民身份证</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（2）教育部学籍在线验证报告</span></p><p><span>（3）推免生预报名申请表</span></p><p><span>（4）诚信复试承诺书</span></p><p><span>（5）个人陈述及其他材料（合并为一份PDF文件，小于10MB）。可以包括本科学习成绩单、外语能力证明、获奖证明及其他能反映研究能力和创新潜质等的材料。封面和文件名须标注报名号，姓名和申请专业。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.报名后，请务必保持通讯畅通、关注系统中的审核状态，并及时查收系统中登记的邮箱（含自动过滤邮件）收到的复试通知。</span></p><p><span>2.2026年推免招生计划数等现阶段尚未最终确定，最终信息以中国研究生招生信息网（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn）、学校研招网公布为准。</span></p><p><span>3.除预报名外，所有通过推荐免试方式攻读我校2026年博士、硕士研究生者均须在正式取得推免生资格，且在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/index.jsp，以下简称“教育部系统”）开通后，履行正式的填写报考志愿、接收并确认院系的复试及待录取通知等程序。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>徐老师：dasezhaosheng@163.com，021-62231630</span></p><p><span>招生、开学季建议优先使用</span><span><strong><span>邮箱</span></strong></span><span>联系，以便我们及时收到并回复您的咨询。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/LWU2lqYH88ZoLVdxw9RsbZvuyskwOz01PKDnAY3aknicibh10QnXfkibYKRfMjVHYLicEDIDiatvnLgzadtDxTsAv0Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span>华东师范大学数据科学与工程学院</span></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/LWU2lqYH88ZoLVdxw9RsbZvuyskwOz01kCLhzydKibfrsr2Xxa2hjKFEnOj9NBwneTOHX1eaQTdiaCuCJ3RvhdYw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"e3bad7e7495db8be72b81477d94c2651efffb457e6cbb4157822148f4e45cb93","textLength":1035,"sourceSha256":"9265d6457f5812c6734e8fccc10b679ecab6ed37cb44151583d0d4b2dea2ed00","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f138ff42eaa7004dd991","title":"2025年华东师范大学数据科学与工程学院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生（含直接攻博）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:07.749930+00:00"}
